<description>&lt;p&gt;Thailand is tightening security in its southern provinces after bomb explosions, while Perlis police increase border intelligence. Cambodia is facilitating ASEAN observers along the Cambodia-Thailand border and raising the dispute at international forums, with Hun Manet citing Trump’s pledge for continued US support and defending Cambodia’s position. Myanmar’s military leader Min Aung Hlaing accuses Thailand of aiding illegal border trade, and a $3 million project will train 4,500 Myanmar refugees for Thai jobs. Malaysia is funding a RM200 million rail link to the border, but Thailand’s connection remains pending. The UCDP recorded 35 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilgFBVV95cUxNc3lYU3I4ZHh2V3dxVTh6SnA1cFpyMFZzdTQ2UGtjUFU3Y1JRS2gyVzdpT2xGa0RLOWwyeW5ZNGM5SWMxLXhRN2NPWkdaZFBFMUhLQTBFYy1NeE1lcnVlaTc0ci1WRmZlNWh5QkpCMmlvYTQ1MzZuZzY0U1N6dkpXVE5JTHRBVDFHR1BaMk9oalo1LTBwd3c?oc=5&quot;&gt;Khmer Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiswFBVV95cUxPcTc1MzFWZHV6cGdTMlRwN1JlaU5CM29kQ0dCUy1MRkh0V3J4S0d4NkFEcjRtUndhZG93TVVWWlZzeHU2akhzdUFNOWR3S1FUejdRdGplaGh1SWFDZXpBaDZpRnBjVlNlaGh0Y0VkRU11VFNHbTRBU2ZLbTM4Sm90anhkemlHU2xobzZ2dW9LR0tGMUJBY19TdTQ1RmZsc21xNXhGQ2gzb0luejI4Sm5OWlJZVQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Khmer Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipgFBVV95cUxNcVRJZHZJX1Jsazc3eEk5bDBXNUh6TjNfOWhmUTdqMHh6WDVJNUVVa29ZWFgzNGRlSnNFLUdaSkYxWldTck85dUtPZWwxYmh2RTNOYjRybGowU1FTRUV4RWhGQzNtLUh6VUdxSUJCejdabmU0YWM5aVhrWnd1Mm1DQ05UNHlJUnFRcHFRRmdnTnVubU5nRzl6NkRYcnpyd3UweDNWaUd3?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Irrawaddy&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqAFBVV95cUxNSWhOaURsTHRuTE9KeEFpVzR5ZG9oSUQ1V0JTbmVldmNFS2NuaEt4cmhNMmhFMzhnbUU1UFRWNmpSSFZHMTV0SHRldlNBWGhmS3VUX1JHVlQtTVJqWlg